  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Emergency Employment Program - Phase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to assist the government in providing employment in rural areas at a minimum wage, as a safety net, to as many people in as short a time as possible.  This objective should be read in conjunction with the objective of government#s NRAP which is to enhance human security and promote equitable economic growth by ensuring year-round access to markets, basic services and facilities in the rural areas of Afghanistan, through promoting local productive capacity, and private sector development of essential rural access infrastructure and employment creation for the rural poor.</narrative>
  </description>
